    "example": "<PricingCard category=\"Plan básico\" active><PricingCard.Price>10 €</PricingCard.Price><PricingCard.AttributeList><PricingCard.AttributeItem>Una característica</PricingCard.AttributeItem></PricingCard.AttributeList></PricingCard>"
